.SH NAME
ein\-llc \- agent\-native EIN.LLC command line
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ein\-llc
.I command
[\fIflags\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Writes one versioned JSON envelope (ein\-llc.cli.v1) on stdout and diagnostics on stderr. Never prompts. Writes preview locally unless confirmed with \-\-yes or \-\-confirm\-effect. Claim, checkout, payment, signing and filing are human\-only and refused.
