.TP
.B assess
Assess a formation need. Without \-\-yes or \-\-confirm\-effect it only previews the request (exit 0, nothing sent). With a task file the result is stored in the existing 0600 continuation record.
.br
Effect: anonymous_record_write. Auth: none. Hosted: served. Recovery: no_reconciliation_route.
.br
Route: POST /api/agent/v1/assessments
.br
  \-\-dry\-run  Preview only. Wins over \-\-yes.
.br
  \-\-yes  Confirm this command's effect (anonymous_record_write).
.br
  \-\-confirm\-effect anonymous_record_write|provisional_application_write  Confirm by naming the exact effect.
.br
  \-\-input VALUE  Read JSON from this file instead of stdin.
.br
  \-\-task\-file VALUE  Continuation record (mode 0600). Default EIN_CONTINUATION_FILE. Omit for a stateless assessment.
.TP
.B prepare
Bound prepare for the task's stored assessment, recipient and operation id, through tools/activation\-continuation. Previews unless confirmed. Stops before the human claim.
.br
Effect: provisional_application_write. Auth: none. Hosted: served. Recovery: caller_key_idempotent_replay.
.br
Route: POST /api/agent/v1/applications
.br
  \-\-yes  Confirm this command's effect (provisional_application_write).
.br
  \-\-confirm\-effect anonymous_record_write|provisional_application_write  Confirm by naming the exact effect.
.br
  \-\-task\-file VALUE  Continuation record (mode 0600). Default EIN_CONTINUATION_FILE.
.br
  \-\-intended\-email VALUE  Human recipient who will claim. Default EIN_CONTINUATION_INTENDED_EMAIL.
.TP
.B task show
Show the stored task record (redacted view from tools/activation\-continuation). No network.
.br
Effect: local_read. Auth: none. Hosted: local. Recovery: local.
.br
  \-\-task\-file VALUE  Default EIN_CONTINUATION_FILE.
.TP
.B task resume
Recover after a lost prepare reply. Without confirmation it sends nothing and reports the stored operation id. With confirmation it sends one replay of that same bound operation (same operationId and body). Stops before the human claim.
.br
Effect: provisional_application_write. Auth: none. Hosted: served. Recovery: caller_key_idempotent_replay.
.br
Route: POST /api/agent/v1/applications
.br
  \-\-yes  Confirm the replay (provisional_application_write).
.br
  \-\-confirm\-effect anonymous_record_write|provisional_application_write  Confirm by naming the exact effect.
.br
  \-\-task\-file VALUE  Default EIN_CONTINUATION_FILE.
.br
  \-\-intended\-email VALUE  Default EIN_CONTINUATION_INTENDED_EMAIL.
.TP
.B task cancel
Cancel the local task record only. The EIN.LLC protocol has no agent cancel; the server case, if any, is not cancelled.
.br
Effect: local_write. Auth: none. Hosted: local. Recovery: local.
.br
  \-\-task\-file VALUE  Default EIN_CONTINUATION_FILE.
.TP
.B status
Read redacted application status with a human\-issued grant from EIN_AGENT_GRANT or EIN_AGENT_GRANT_FILE, sent only to EIN_AGENT_GRANT_ORIGIN.
.br
Effect: read_only. Auth: agent_grant. Hosted: served. Recovery: read_retry.
.br
Route: GET /api/agent/v1/applications/{applicationId}/status
.br
  \-\-application\-id VALUE  Application id.
.TP
.B doctor
Check health, origin, grant presence (never values) and task file safety.
.br
Effect: read_only. Auth: none. Hosted: served_unlisted. Recovery: read_retry.
.br
Route: GET /api/healthz
.br
  \-\-task\-file VALUE  Default EIN_CONTINUATION_FILE.
.TP
.B claim
Always refused (human_step_required). The intended recipient claims at the review URL.
.br
Effect: human_only. Auth: human_only. Hosted: human_only. Recovery: not_dispatched.
.br
  \-\-task\-file VALUE  Default EIN_CONTINUATION_FILE; used only to show the review URL.
.TP
.B checkout
Always refused (funded_step_refused). Checkout and payment are human\-only.
.br
Effect: human_only. Auth: human_only. Hosted: human_only. Recovery: not_dispatched.
.br
  \-\-task\-file VALUE  Default EIN_CONTINUATION_FILE; used only to show the review URL.
