API origin, scheme and host only (default EIN_LLC_ORIGIN or https://ein.llc). http is allowed only for loopback.
.TP
.B \-\-timeout\-ms N
Per\-request deadline (default 15000, max 60000).
.TP
.B \-\-max\-response\-bytes N
Per\-response bound (default 1048576, max 4194304).
.TP
.B \-\-retries N
Bounded retries for read\-only GETs on unavailable or rate_limited (default 0, backoff 250 ms doubling).
.TP
.B \-\-correlation\-id VALUE
Optional non\-authorizing correlation id (Agent Entry task\-continuation v1 format). Echoed as correlationId; never sent to the server, never a credential.
.TP
.B \-\-json
Machine output. Already the default; accepted for clarity.
.TP
