.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B EIN_LLC_ORIGIN
API origin (default https://ein.llc).
.TP
.B EIN_CONTINUATION_FILE
Task record path (mode 0600); same as \-\-task\-file.
.TP
.B EIN_CONTINUATION_CUSTOMER_KEY
Opaque caller key, 12 to 128 characters; stored only as a hash.
.TP
.B EIN_CONTINUATION_TASK_ID
Stable task id; otherwise read from the record or generated on first assess.
.TP
.B EIN_CONTINUATION_INTENDED_EMAIL
Human recipient who will claim; same as \-\-intended\-email.
.TP
.B EIN_CONTINUATION_REASSESS
Set to 1 to assess again deliberately after a lost assess reply.
.TP
.B EIN_AGENT_GRANT
Human\-issued status grant (value never printed).
.TP
.B EIN_AGENT_GRANT_FILE
File holding the grant (mode 0600).
.TP
.B EIN_AGENT_GRANT_ORIGIN
Origin the grant may be sent to; must exactly equal the request origin (default https://ein.llc).
